OL,4,BThe American manager with a maths      
OL,5,Bdegree making history in La Liga       
OL,6,GFrom kicking a ball around in the      
OL,7,Gparks of New Jersey to lifting the     
OL,8,GCopa del Rey with Real Sociedad,       
OL,9,GPellegrino Matarazzo's journey to      
OL,10,Gmanaging the La Liga side has been     
OL,11,Ganything but conventional.             
OL,13,FHe studied applied mathematics at      
OL,14,FColumbia University, played football   
OL,15,Fin Germany's lower divisions and       
OL,16,Feventually became the first American   
OL,17,Fmanager in La Liga history when he     
OL,18,Fjoined the San Sebastian club in       
OL,19,FDecember 2025.                         
